<title>LATVIA: MULTIBANKA '96 PROFIT RISES TO 153,000 LATS.</title>
<headline>MULTIBANKA '96 PROFIT RISES TO 153,000 LATS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Multibanka, among the 20 biggest banks in Latvia in terms of assets, said on Friday that its shareholders meeting confirmed a 1996 undivided profit figure of 153,000 lats versus 21,000 lats in 1995.</p>
<p>Multibanka's assets rose to 16,923 million lats against 9,693 million in the previous year, the bank said in a brief statement.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
